// Stormglass Commons Character Appearance H3G.
//
// This read-only look-development composition inherits H3F scalp-flow geometry
// and authors native card-width coverage plus tangent-aware highlight response.
// HoloScript requests a 4x multisampled alpha-to-coverage pipeline and carries a
// material receipt through character-webgpu. This is card coverage, not strand
// hair, scan-derived grooming, production grooming, or photorealism.
//
// Every persona also authors source_color_weight: how much of the authored hair
// chroma survives over the melanin response. HoloLand authors that number; it is
// not inherited from an upstream default. Each value is deliberately distinct and
// none equals the upstream unauthored default, so the receipt can tell an authored
// weight apart from a defaulted one.

composition "Stormglass Character Appearance H3G Hair Response" {
  metadata {
    title: "Stormglass Character Appearance H3G - Native Hair Coverage and Response"
    version: "0.1.0"
    date: "2026-07-28"
    milestone: "MV_CHARACTER_APPEARANCE_H3G_HAIR_RESPONSE"
    source: "source/layers/vr/frontier/model-village/model-village-character-appearance-h3g-hair-response.holo"
